[00:00.00]Dear Friends,
[00:01.29]I am writing the email to introduce one of the most prestigious Chinese celebrities to you,
[00:09.49]Confucius.
[00:10.56]Being a great thinker,
[00:12.61]educator and founder of Confucianism,
[00:16.17]Confucius is an ancient sage during the Spring and Autumn Period.
[00:22.10]His words and life story were recorded by his disciples and their students inThe Analects.
[00:30.30]As an enduring classic of Chinese ancient culture,The Analectshas influenced almost all thinkers,
[00:39.47]writers and politicians in the over-2,000-year-long history of China since Confucius.
[00:47.55]Much of Confucian thought on Heaven and Man represents universal human values.
[00:54.78]This is perhaps why Confucian thought in the 21st century still remains the interest of not only the Chinese people but also people in other parts of the world.
